        "Id1": {
            "text": "Brandon Carter was born in England on January 1st, 1942. He is a physicist and a professional in the field of general relativity. Dennis William Sciama was his doctoral advisor. Carter is known for inventing the Carter constant and proving the no-hair theorem."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "Born in England on 01-01-1942, Brandon Carter is a professional in the field of general relativity who was previously supervised by Dennis William Sciama, his doctoral advisor. He is known for the Carter constant as well as the No-hair theorem."
        },
